# Copy to deploy/hosted/ai.env (never commit it). Only the forecast worker reads it.
# Provider and model default to openai / gpt-6-sol in compose.yaml. Without a key the
# desk is still attempted and records provider_unavailable; the corrected forecast issues.
#
# Omit a line rather than leaving it blank: a present but empty setting is invalid.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME
# MESOFORGE_AI_REASONING_EFFORT=low
# MESOFORGE_AI_INPUT_USD_PER_MILLION=REPLACE_WITH_PRICE
# MESOFORGE_AI_OUTPUT_USD_PER_MILLION=REPLACE_WITH_PRICE
